{"id":"vod_sn_36201","vodId":"36201","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"交响诗篇","name_cn":"交响诗篇","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第50集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/0107bd3480a739a0c8cea0e843bbabab.jpg"},"summary":"在一场人类的浩劫之中，兰顿（三瓶由布子 配音）的父亲牺牲了自己，拯救了地球，被称为英雄永久的记入了史册。失去父亲后，兰顿一直和身为机械工程师的祖父相依为命。日复一日的寻常生活让兰顿感到十分压抑，只有一件事情能够激起他的兴趣，那就是在青年之中十分流行的“滑空”运动。兰顿十分仰慕滑空天才霍兰德（藤原启治 配音），一直希望能够加入他的组织“月光洲”。　　某日，一位名叫优莱卡（名冢佳织 配音）的神秘女孩驾驶着一架故障的LOF从天而降落到了兰顿的家中，随后，军队赶到，似乎在对优莱卡进行追捕。兰顿凭借着自己的勇气和实力战胜了军队，并因此而获得了加入月光洲的机会，少年平凡的命运就此改变。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:41:11","playable":true,"episodeCount":50,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KLfsfegrxE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nYP6VLYbnj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WfmXnkuMmE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Kzv89S8M6B1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Z5Xt5NaNSA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2zUKm64Xkr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7ejHJvGxwd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zCxxYKP80W1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/65QsUYX6KQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zV1m0w6Mv21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Zf7SAJjWB81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Td6XJ6vMu71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/i7zQNYkN631/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RUvDtHK8Sz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":